## Summary

Describe the exact source change and rollback boundary.

## Governance

Link the approved work and owner evidence. Agent Gary authors source; the
accountable human separately reviews the exact head and merges. Identify any
security or authority impact. Source controls are not application acceptance,
Inventory admission, runtime activation or release permission.

## Validation

Record actual commands, base/head, results and evidence. Distinguish owner
control validation from application tests and required operating proof.

## Advisory Review

Advisory review is optional, not an approval gate. If requested, record the
provider, scope, findings and verification. Disposition each finding as
fix-now, separate-work or reject-with-reason, with justification.
